Jialiang!

23:32.790 --> 23:33.480
Jiashu!

23:35.070 --> 23:38.200
Anak dewa turun ke dunia,
mayat berjalan melawan arus air.

23:38.200 --> 23:41.350
Anak dewa turun ke dunia,
mayat berjalan melawan arus air!

